# Full-size camera originals. The repo root is the publish root, so anything
# tracked here is downloadable from the live site - only the optimised crops in
# assets/img belong in it, and the build fails on any served image over 100KB.
# This directory is ~23MB of untouched originals. Avatars regenerate with
# tools/make-avatars.ps1.
assets/img/Real Photos/

# A screenshot of the DKIM DNS records, kept locally for reference. Same
# reason as above: the repo root is the publish root, so committing it would
# publish our DNS configuration at a guessable URL.
assets/Capture.PNG
